[enu default]

M1_Cabinet01 =
"\cDIt won't budge.";

M1_Cabinet01Fail =
"\cDThe doors remain stuck.\n\cR(STR 1 Required)";

ENG_M02B1 =
"There exists 5 conduits this entity uses to link its influence into the space here. Destroy them and what they unveil.\n\n"

"Next, I camouflaged you from the creature's sight. In the event that you destroyed a conduit. You will not be "
"immediately slaughtered and mauled into a red stain.\n\n"

"Finally, I have translated a quick summary of this entity into your device, and the location of these conduits. Written based on your own structural template.";

ENG_M02B2 =
"This entity has always existed intangibly. Its life cycle is the very history of all life on this world. They... well you... are one of its many stages of evolution. \n\n"
"...\n\n"
"Picture having to engineer a replica of yourself, but you possess neither the necessary equipments nor knowledge.\n\n"

"For this thing to realize its own existence, it waders through the muck in darkness. It grows limbs, organs, and competes amongst itself. "
"All exists to awaken and test a new paradigm. Soon even your brain will no longer be the most important organ. You may also see you kin unshackled "
"from the burdens of gravity. Before you know it, the mysteries of space and time will be but a mundane phenomenon. \n\n"

"You see... after persisting through all the possible epochs, the remaining evolutionary product is its truest self.\n\n"
"As of now, we bare witness to one transition... the unification of duality.";

ENG_M02B3 =
"\cDWithout any explanation. Your handgun levitates into mid-air between you and the engineer. As it floats, the magazine slowly removes itself, emptying every stored bullet.\n\n"
"Afterwards, both the grip and the magazine begin to lengthen on their own. At the same time, bullets begin to materialize from thin air, you think that's 2 more than you can usually store.\n\n"
"In an expert and elegant manner, the weapon loads itself and is then passed back to you.";

ADB_M02B1 =
"\cDPerhaps it's the unusual presence of enriched psychic energy in the air. Or maybe it's the one who is much "
"more fluent in the arts of telepathy than you are. Regardless, you see fully, with perfect clarity, what these beings are.\n\n"

"They come from a different world, one devoid of all dimensions.\n"
"When these beings visit new planes of existence across unfathomable light years, they would seek out worlds nesting sentient life.";

ADB_M02B2 =
"\cDOn arrival, they begin watch from the exosphere, picking inhabitants to assimilate. A seed is linked between psyches, so that upon returning to the great empty, "
"they will lead a new life in an everlasting dream. The unsuspecting targets too will reawaken in bliss, unbeknownst of the shared "
"consciousness. What could be this feeling? A new calling in life? New way in thinking? What depths may we traverse in these mutual gifts?\n\n"

"Conspiracies about such hijackers of the body and mind continue to rage on. But all answers dim into eventual blackness. "
"Anecdotes and speculations suggest that only under strict condition can their presence be felt. But communion is impossible. "
"Fitting... for they are spectres of the cosmos";

GATE_01 =
"\cDYou carefully apply the material onto your body. And on moving closer to the gate, it slowly starts to vaporize.\n\n"
"Alas, the way ahead is now safe. Sort of.";

GATE_02 =
"\cDAs you recite the passage. A primordial chaos begin to heat up the surrounding air. There is no telling if this is the flame that burns at the beginning nor end of time.\n\n"
"Alas, the space-time starts to stablize. The way ahead is now safe.";

GATE_03 =
"\cDThe chicken evaporated immediately. It's as if you never even held it a second prior.\n\n"
"Alas, the space-time starts to stablize. The way ahead is now safe.";

CORPSE01_02B =
"\cDThe lights are outrunning you. Everything hurts. But why are the walls talking?...\n\n"
"You remember the methods to dismantle the panel. Maybe. Simple... tricky. The offering is to be carried out as a sign of good faith.\n\n"
"You will be the one to commune with the divine.";
